---
title: Black Bean and Sweet Potato Chili
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [soup, meatless, vegetarian, freezer, slow-cooker]
cook time: 8 hours
---

> About 16 g fiber and 16 g protein per serving. Protein is low, so serve with Greek yogurt, or add 1 lb ground turkey (no longer meatless).

Put @black beans{30%oz}(drained), @pinto beans{15%oz}(drained), @frozen sweet potato{3%cups}(cubes), @bell pepper{1}(chopped), @onion{1}(chopped), @fire-roasted tomatoes{14%oz}, @chili powder{2%tbsp}, @ground cumin{1%tsp} and @vegetable broth{2%cups} in a #slow cooker{}.

Cook on low for ~{7-8%hours}, or use the Instant Pot soup setting.
